{%- comment -%}
  Product information panel.

  Rendered from sections/product-information.liquid rather than added to
  templates/product.json as a section: Shopify's GitHub sync stopped applying
  changes to that JSON template (its live copy is pinned to an older version
  while every Liquid file in the same pushes deploys normally), so the content
  has to arrive through a Liquid file to reach the store at all.

  These three bodies of text used to be accordions inside the buy column,
  where they competed with the price and the add to cart button for the same
  narrow strip, and pushed the button down the page every time one opened.

  Layout: the description leads at a reading measure, with the practical
  facts beside it as a short labelled list.

  Two earlier passes were wrong in instructive ways. Three equal columns of
  gray body text gave the product's own words the same weight as the returns
  policy and read like any theme's spec table. Replacing two of those columns
  with shadowed white cards was worse: elevation there communicated no
  hierarchy, it just added material. What the facts need is separation, which
  space and a single hairline give for free.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- assign panel_product = product -%}

<div class="product-info-panel">
  <div class="product-info-panel__inner page-width-content">
    {% if panel_product.description != blank %}
      <div class="product-info-panel__lead rte">{{ panel_product.description }}</div>
    {% endif %}

    <dl class="product-info-panel__facts">
      <div class="product-info-panel__fact">
        <dt>החומר</dt>
        <dd>עץ בוטיק, חיתוך לייזר בדיוק של שבריר מילימטר, תאורה רכה מבפנים.</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="product-info-panel__fact">
        <dt>זמן אספקה</dt>
        <dd>יוצא תוך 1 עד 3 ימי עסקים, מגיע תוך 2 עד 6 ימי עסקים.</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="product-info-panel__fact">
        <dt>החזרות</dt>
        <dd>14 יום להחזרה, משלוח ההחזרה על חשבוננו.</dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
  </div>
</div>

{% style %}
  .product-info-panel {
    background-color: #f7f5f2;
    padding-block: 96px;
  }

  .product-info-panel__inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.5fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 72px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .product-info-panel__lead {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    line-height: 2;
    color: #33333d;
    max-width: 36rem;
  }

  .product-info-panel__lead p {
    margin: 0 0 20px;
  }

  .product-info-panel__lead p:last-child {
    margin-block-end: 0;
  }

  .product-info-panel__facts {
    margin: 0;
    padding-block-start: 8px;
    /* One hairline, on the group, rather than a rule under every row. */
    border-block-start: 1px solid rgba(26, 26, 46, 0.14);
  }

  .product-info-panel__fact {
    padding-block: 22px;
  }

  .product-info-panel__fact dt {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: rgba(26, 26, 46, 0.45);
    margin-block-end: 8px;
  }

  .product-info-panel__fact dd {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #5a554d;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .product-info-panel {
      padding-block: 64px;
    }

    .product-info-panel__inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 40px;
    }

    .product-info-panel__lead {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      line-height: 1.85;
      max-width: none;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}
